Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For centuries, the enigmatic truth behind Every night, a lonely boy wished he could stop time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.46,0:00:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, his wish came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He could freeze everything around him… the rain, the wind, even people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, he felt like a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He used his power to win fights, avoid pain, and escape every problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But slowly, he noticed something terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time he stopped time, someone he loved forgot a memory of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,First, his best friend forgot their childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, his mother forgot his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Desperate, he stopped time one final time and whispered… “I don't need a world that stops for me.
